*.pk3
__pycache__/
*.bak
_old/
# Engine logs written into this folder, and run.ps1's test logs.
doomxr-log.txt
log-debug.txt
wm_last.log
logs/

# python caches from the card tools
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# CARDKIT HOLDS NO MODELS. It is a toolkit: scripts, docs, one config per set, and
# the cards it generates. Every mesh under it is REGENERATED from the donor --
# `wm/` by prep_wm (the gun at its resting pose, pieces named) and `src/` by
# bake_rig (a Quake3 rig flattened into one animated mesh). They came to 334 MB
# against 1.2 MB of actual kit, and one baked Browning alone was 55 MB, over
# GitHub's file limit. The shipped copies live in the weapon package, where models
# belong.
CardKit/sets/*/wm/
CardKit/sets/*/src/
